wb:text/class-feature/shadow-sheath:
Usage a holster or sheath shaped for a one-handed thrown weapon of light Bulk or less With an infinite array of darts, throwing knives, or similar weapons, you never need worry about being unarmed. You can spend 1 minute to load a weapon meeting the shadow sheath's usage requirements into the sheath, which is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] somewhere on your person. 
